<title>SWITZERLAND: CSFB forecasts for Swiss interest rates.</title>
<headline>CSFB forecasts for Swiss interest rates.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston gave these forecasts for Swiss interest/forex rates:</p>
<p> (midrates)	     April 21     one month	 six months</p>
<p> 3-mo Sfr deposits    1.88	    1.80		0.50</p>
<p> 6-mo Sfr deposits    1.94	    1.95		0.58</p>
<p> 12-mo Sfr deposits   2.05	    2.05		0.68</p>
<p> 2-year swaps	   2.32	    2.25		1.25</p>
<p> 5-year swaps	   3.18	    3.10		2.50</p>
<p> 10-year swaps	  4.02	    3.95		3.30</p>
<p> 10-yr govt bonds     3.67	    3.60		3.15</p>
<p> DEM/CHF		  85.14	   85.00	     93.00</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
